# Hugging Face repo id the text-generation model is downloaded from, in
# `owner/name` form. Transformers.js resolves it against the Hub itself.
#
# Leave unset to use the upstream repo (Xenova/LaMini-Flan-T5-77M), which is
# the default - a fresh clone runs with no configuration needed.
#
# Set it to point the app at a different copy of the model. Requirements for
# that repo:
#   1. it must be PUBLIC - the browser downloads the files with no token, and
#      a Hub token embedded in client-side JS would be readable by anyone, and
#   2. it must keep the upstream file layout, including the onnx/ subfolder
#      (config.json, tokenizer.json, tokenizer_config.json,
#      generation_config.json, onnx/encoder_model_quantized.onnx,
#      onnx/decoder_model_merged_quantized.onnx).
#
# See docs/huggingface-model-upload.md for the full upload procedure.
#
# VITE_HF_MODEL_ID=your-username/LaMini-Flan-T5-77M
